          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Flattening the blocked-cell matrix into one contiguous byte array improves row-major locality, while a single in-place DP row removes the second-row copy. The recurrence remains O(N²) and handles every valid obstacle placement, including blocked endpoints.",
