          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "The in-place row DP has a loop-carried dependency across columns, so SIMD vectorization is not legal without restructuring. This conservative experiment replaces the proxy blocked-cell matrix with row-wise sparse blocked-column lists and skips cells between obstacles, retaining the same sequential recurrence while reducing work for sparse blocked rows. Performance depends on obstacle distribution; all inputs retain equivalent cell-by-cell updates where needed.",
